=== Group O ===
Done. `GroupOIT` is green: **`Tests run: 9, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`** (103 s, one Quarkus boot) via the mandated command.

## What was built
`src/test/java/com/intermarche/pos/e2e/GroupOIT.java` — 9 `@Test` methods covering the whole §O inventory, driven through the public HTTP surface + peripheral simulator, one `@QuarkusTest` boot:

- **O-A** (3 methods, split by state family): the 11 scan-zone messages, the 5 line-action messages, and the 4 state-guard messages — each asserted **shown and cleared on the next scan** (the transitory contract).
- **O-B**: lock (`IDENTIFIANTS INCORRECTS`, `COMPTE VERROUILLÉ` persisting), session (`OUVERTURE IMPOSSIBLE`, plus the training block proven on the 303 `Location` since `GET /session` never renders it), and the 4 PIN-change messages.
- **O-C**: `RIEN À REMBOURSER`, the in-transaction `PLAFOND DU TICKET DÉPASSÉ` (endorsed then rolled back), `RETOURS INDISPONIBLES EN FORMATION`.
- **O-D**: `Numéro non reconnu — vérifiez la saisie`, `Type de bon inconnu`.
- **O-E** (3 methods): the four gesture modals + `VALEUR INVALIDE` + cancel/validate/endorsement (`AUTORISATION REFUSÉE`, badge prefill, abandon); the TPE overlay (appear/accept/refuse/cancel) + completion modal (IMPRIMER keeps the draft OPEN, NOUVELLE VENTE closes, overpay `Rendu Client`); the drawer interstitial (GET→path, POST→referer no replay) + the FORMATION z-50 banner.

**Scope:** only the new test class was written — nothing under `src/main` was modified.

## Iterations
Three runs: 5/9 → 7/9 → 9/9. The three real discoveries: `getTargetItem` falls back to the last line (so AUCUNE LIGNE needs an empty cart); the register's `/api/hardware/tpe/*` routes are shadowed by the simulator mounted at the same root, so accept/refuse are played via the injected `PaymentService` bean like GroupFIT/KIT; and `GET /pay` is `@DrawerMayBeOpen`, so the drawer-block test uses the guarded `/manual`.

## Justified residue
The four store-node/interrupt supervisor outcomes (biface `[N]`), `QUANTITÉ DÉJÀ REMBOURSÉE` (needs a concurrent second refund a single-operator register can't host), `ACTION DE REMBOURSEMENT INCONNUE` and `Aucun opérateur connecté` (defensive branches no HTTP path reaches), and the three valuation banners (`[V]` module). Full rationale in **`reports/O.md`**.
Done. `GroupOIT` is green: **`Tests run: 9, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`** (103 s, one Quarkus boot) via the mandated command.

